work/
*.gpkg
*.qgz
__pycache__/

# out/ is working data (accessibility gpkg/csv/params.json, per-city summaries)
# -- not versioned per CLAUDE.md's "CSV wynikow" rule. Carve-outs: the roll-up
# tables, the hypothesis verdict, and the transfer-ring chart PNGs.
out/*
!out/cross_city_delay.csv
!out/cross_city_net.csv
!out/run_stats.csv
!out/run_stats.json
!out/hex_breakdown.csv
!out/gtfs_shift_by_traction.csv
!out/HYPOTHESIS.md
# probe_poznan_*.csv (full O-D matrix, ~50 MB each) stay unversioned; the
# summary numbers live in FINDINGS.md
!out/charts/
out/charts/*
!out/charts/transfer_ring_*.png
!out/charts/README.md
